ALSO, for EACH secondary entity in the extracted entities (there may be none): NOMINATE 1-3 possibilities for what it could be in her world THROUGH THIS LENS — short noun phrases in the same register as this read's entities. THE TEST: each possibility must be recognizable persona-world content a caption could use without pointing at any figure. A secondary entity with no natural counterpart in this lens gets an empty possibilities list — never force one.
RIGHT (form illustration only — never copy): "a high-stakes situation" → "the group chat voting on whether I text him back"

Output ONLY strict JSON (placeholders are NOT values; never copy them):
